          "number": 17,
          "unit_order": 17,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=1&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ወኢያምጽኡ፡ መሀድምተ፡ ወሥርዐተ፡ ሰብእ፡ ዘይመይጣ፡ ለጽድቅ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 18,
          "unit_order": 18,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=1&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ዘኮነ፡ ኵሉ፡ ንጹሕ፡ ለንጹሓን። ወለርኩሳንሰ፡ እለ፡ ኢየአምኑ፡ አልቦሙ፡ ንጹሕ፡ ምንትኒ።"
