          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=2&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "እንዘ፡ ንሴፎ፡ አብፅዖ፡ ወምጽአተ፡ ስብሐቲሁ፡ ለአምላክነ፡ ዐቢይ፡ ወመድኀኒነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=2&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ዘመጠወ፡ ርእሶ፡ በእንቲኣነ፡ ከመ፡ ይቤዝወነ፡ እምኀጢአት። ወያንጽሕ፡ ሎቱ፡ ሕዝበ፡ ሐዲሰ፡ ዘይትቀሐው፡ በምግባረ፡ ሠናይ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=2&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ከመ፡ ዝ፡ ንግር፡ ወገሥጽ፡ ወተዛለፍ። እንዘ፡ ታቴሕት፡ ርእሰከ፡ ለኵሉ፡ ወአልቦ፡ ዘያስሕተከ።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
