          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ዘሦጠ፡ ላዕሌነ፡ በብዕሉ፡ በእንተ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ መድኀኒነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "ከመ፡ ንጽደቅ፡ በጸጋሁ፡ ወንረስ፡ ተስፋ፡ ሕይወት፡ ዘለዓለም።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "8",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "እሙን፡ ነገር፡ ወበእንተ፡ ዝ፡ እፈቅድ፡ አነሂ፡ ታጽንዖሙ። ከመ፡ የኀልዩ፡ ተራድኦ፡ በኵሉ፡ ምግባረ፡ ሠናይ፡ እለ፡ ተአመኑ፡ በእግዚአብሔር። ዝኬ፡ ሠናይ፡ ዘይበቊዖ፡ ለሰብእ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=9"
          ],
          "text": "ነገረ፡ ጋእዝ፡ ወእበድ፡ ዘይፈጥሩ፡ ወመሐድምተ፡ ወወክሐ፡ ተገሐሦሙ። እስመ፡ ከንቱ፡ ውእቱ፡ ወኢይበቊዕ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 11,
          "unit_order": 11,
          "source_marker": "10",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=10"
          ],
          "text": "ለመስተካሕድ፡ ብእሲ፡ እምከመ፡ ምዕረ፡ ወካዕበ፡ ገሠጽኮ፡ ወአበየ፡ ኀድጎ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 12,
          "unit_order": 12,
          "source_marker": "11",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=11"
          ],
          "text": "ወአእምሮ፡ ከመ፡ ዐላዊ፡ ውእቱ። ዘከማሁ፡ ያስሕት፡ ወያጌጊ፡ ወይረክብ፡ ኵነኔ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 13,
          "unit_order": 13,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "ማኅተመ፡ መልእክት"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወእምከመ፡ ፈነውክዎ፡ ለአርጢሞን፡ ኀቤከ፡ አው፡ ጢኪቆስ። ፍጡነ፡ ነዐ፡ ኀቤየ፡ ሀገረ፡ ናቆጵል፡ እስመ፡ አጥባዕኩ፡ እክርም፡ ህየ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=Tit&chapter=3&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "ለዜማስ፡ ጸሓፌ፡ ሀገር፡ ወአጵሎስ፡ ጽሑቀ፡ አክብሮሙ፡ ኢይጸነሱ፡ ምንተኒ።"
        },
